# Search service (port 3003). Public, no token. Videos appear here once their video.ready event is indexed.
@search = http://localhost:3003

### Full-text search: title counts 3x, typos are forgiven, the last word may be partial
GET {{search}}/search?q=cats&limit=12

?? status == 200
?? js response.parsedBody.total isNumber
?? js Array.isArray(response.parsedBody.items)

### Second page
GET {{search}}/search?q=cats&limit=12&offset=12

?? status == 200

### Autocomplete while typing (prefix of any word in the title)
GET {{search}}/search/suggest?q=ca

?? status == 200
?? js response.parsedBody.items.length <= 5

### Blank query is rejected
GET {{search}}/search?q=

?? status == 400

### Liveness
GET {{search}}/health

?? status == 200
